# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale fi
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as ilta [18:00, 23:00)
# (CLDR evening1).
# Surface: illalla, the adessive of ilta "evening" (the stem loses its t:
# ilta -> illa-).
# Source: Wiktionary, "illalla": Finnish adverb, glossed "in the evening",
# and the adessive singular of "ilta".
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/illalla
# CLDR 47 fi names this period "illalla" in the format-wide day periods.
illalla
